      "en": "Will the snow of Lebanon fail from the rock of the field? Will the cold waters that flow down from afar be dried up?",
      "ko": "레바논의 눈이 어찌 들의 반석을 떠나겠으며 원방에서 흘러내리는 찬물이 어찌 마르겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "87d078aa78032b0469f0c49959a8207d2a9457c997be9364e3b8155a21e21c66",
      "translation_text_hash": "93c7bbe64b30902b91d49137eafc8d26c4a1d2a9087e3640343dfeb3d18ef950",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
