      "en": "to make their land an astonishment, and a perpetual hissing. Everyone who passes by it will be astonished, and shake his head.",
      "ko": "그들의 땅으로 놀랍고 영영한 치소가 되게 하리니 그리로 지나는 자마다 놀라서 그 머리를 흔들리라",
      "source_text_hash": "cc3331ee058c680013b2ba59c9f0118dce909d4c9114eaa0015c5c4fcf6cc9c4",
      "translation_text_hash": "ca410060913be5518316fd5aec5d78ef503dfa5ffe50152f81e4279ac4db6016",
