      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 18,
          "verse": 19
        }
      ],
      "en": "Give heed to me, LORD, and listen to the voice of those who contend with me.",
      "ko": "여호와여 나를 돌아 보사 나로 더불어 다투는 그들의 목소리를 들어보옵소서",
      "source_text_hash": "e9ae64bde0acbf8253c0dfd1201900666e86f26771c539eac4a5eeff4c782c6f",
      "translation_text_hash": "f6e127bfc92f4d3d63710f68555c89bc4ae714f45d61d175523c0946f9f1aaca",
